---
title: "destroy_and_withdraw (Sui Framework: transfer_policy)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_owner: assert object::id(self) == cap.policy_id
    q_check_owner --> q_abort: IDs don't match
    q_abort --> [*]: abort ENotOwner
    q_check_owner --> q_destruct_cap: owner verified
    q_destruct_cap --> q_destruct_policy: TransferPolicyCap destructured
    q_destruct_policy --> q_delete_ids: TransferPolicy(id, rules, balance) destructured
    q_delete_ids --> q_emit: id.delete(), cap_id.delete()
    q_emit --> [*]: emit TransferPolicyDestroyed, return balance.into_coin()

    note right of q_destruct_policy
        INV-001: both policy and cap are destroyed
        INV-002: all accumulated balance returned as coin
        INV-003: type T becomes non-tradable in kiosks without another policy
        INV-004: remaining rules are discarded (not individually cleaned up)
    end note
